   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Jobs and Tasks make deliveries but keep no delivery/; they keep their own Report (s09-D02)\nevery writer goes through one helper, haipipe-draft/src/common.py (s02-D14)\nRuns and Results stay with their source; only built files land in delivery/\nopened from Job j01, Delivery is the Block's, with j01 picked in its source row (s03-D06)\nDelivery sits at the right end of the top row: Studio | Block · Job · Task | Delivery",
   "originalText": "Jobs and Tasks make deliveries but keep no delivery/; they keep their own Report (s09-D02)\nevery writer goes through one helper, haipipe-draft/src/common.py (s02-D14)\nRuns and Results stay with their source; only built files land in delivery/\nopened from Job j01, Delivery is the Block's, with j01 picked in its source row (s03-D06)\nDelivery sits at the right end of the top row: Studio | Block · Job · Task | Delivery",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 6,
